@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+{% extends "legal/_base.html" %}
+{% block body %}
+<p>We want Capture IV to be usable by everyone who works on or follows a construction project, including people who use assistive technology.</p>
+
+<h2>What we do</h2>
+<ul>
+<li>Pages include a "Skip to main content" link, labelled form fields and buttons, and keyboard-operable controls.</li>
+<li>We test changes against common accessibility guidance and fix issues we find.</li>
+</ul>
+
+<h2>Known limitations</h2>
+<p>Some map, drawing and video features are highly visual and may be harder to use with a screen reader or keyboard alone. Where you need project information in another format, your project team or our support team can help.</p>
+
+<h2>Feedback</h2>
+<p>If something is difficult to use, tell us at <a href="mailto:{{ legal.contact_email }}">{{ legal.contact_email }}</a> with the page and what you were trying to do. We aim to respond and work on a fix or an alternative.</p>
+{% endblock %}
